        service area.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Reservations & Booking</h2>
      <p>
        All reservations must be made through our official website or by direct
        contact with our team. A reservation is not confirmed until you receive
        a written confirmation from Posh Limousines of Atlanta. We reserve the
        right to decline or cancel any booking at our discretion.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Payment Terms</h2>
      <p>
        Payment is due at the time of booking or as otherwise agreed in writing.
        We accept major credit cards and approved payment methods. All prices
        are in U.S. dollars and are subject to applicable taxes, tolls, parking
        fees, and gratuity unless stated otherwise. Rates are subject to change
        without prior notice except for confirmed reservations.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Cancellation Policy</h2>
