          </svg>
          <span><strong>48+ hours notice:</strong> Full refund issued.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong>24–48 hours notice:</strong> 50% refund issued.</span>
