        <li>Illegal substances of any kind</li>
        <li>Smoking or vaping inside any vehicle</li>
        <li>Verbal or physical abuse toward chauffeurs or other passengers</li>
        <li>Vandalism or damage to vehicles</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The Company reserves the right to terminate any trip immediately due to
        misconduct. In such cases, no refund will be issued. The passenger will
